| "Prefer first plan-shaped" | `first_plan_among_many.md`: non-plan JSON, then plan A, then plan B → plan A wins |
| Legacy fallbacks | `single_block.md` (single fence), `bare_json_no_fence.md` (embedded JSON), `invalid_fence_then_valid.md` (broken fence skipped), `garbage.md` → `ErrNoJSONFound` (never an empty "success") |
| Scanner robustness | Non-JSON fence first, ~~~ fences, CRLF, string-aware bracket matching (`}` and `\"` inside strings) |
