| Never retried on API/network errors | httptest mocks: 400, 429, 500, error-payload body, and hijacked connection drop → exactly **1** request each, correct error types |
| End-to-end | `TestCompletePlan_EndToEnd`: mock OpenRouter returns multi-fence output → plan JSON extracted through both layers |
